THE SWIFT RUNTIME
-----------------

On Android and Windows the Swift standard library is packaged with the
application, because neither platform has one - .scripts/build-android.sh and
.scripts/build-windows.ps1 copy it in, so every application built with StateUI
carries it. Apple platforms have it in the OS and nothing is copied.

