WHAT IS NOT HERE, AND WHY
-------------------------

No fonts. The .NET MAUI project template ships Open Sans, which is Apache 2.0
and would need its license and its NOTICE carried with the application. This
repository has no font files at all: the sample asks for whatever the platform
draws with.

No borrowed artwork. Every icon, the splash and the application icon are
hand-written SVG in apps/Gallery/Resources/.

Nothing from the test tools. xunit and the .NET test SDK are used to build and
check this repository and are not part of anything shipped.


WHEN TO ADD TO THIS FILE
------------------------

Whenever something third-party is COPIED IN rather than referenced: a font, an
icon, a sound, a snippet of somebody else's code. A package reference does not
belong here; a file that ends up in the repository does.
